        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a touching story</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The little boy Kiddo has spent most of his life in the hospital. Little does he know what a complicated and fascinating world lies concealed beyond the hospital walls.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today, on Kiddo's birthday, his mom wasn't around. Instead of her, the boy met Shadow, who inspired him to escape from a hospital and search for his mom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, hide and run from enemies, make friends, and help the boy get home.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real adventures lie in wait for Kiddo! Now his fate is in your hands…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112220/extras/095729b540029107f8877832a2b5ab24.avif?t=1772681989\" width=616 height=303 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●\tLook at ordinary things through the eyes of a child. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●\tHelp the boy overcome his illness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●\tTry to hide from troubles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●\tPlay with a garbage rat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●\tTame a puppy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●\tHide in a public toilet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●\tWhisk the bees away from the honey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●\tCreate a story about your adventures and document it in your album.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●\tExplore a small town and unravel its mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●\tMeet Shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●\tKeep the balance between light and dark by making tough decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragr